sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Customer
    participant P as Customer panel
    participant A as Core: Auth module
    participant C as ARcaptcha
    participant Y as Yaghut
    participant N as SMS Notifier
    participant DB as Oracle
    U->>P: internet-bank username, password, captcha
    P->>A: POST /api/auth/customer/login
    A->>C: verify token (customer keys)
    C-->>A: success true
    A->>Y: POST /user/loginStatic
    Y-->>A: JSESSIONID, code (national code), checks as for agencies
    A->>DB: request exists for this national code? customer locked_until passed?
    alt code differs, or customer locked out
        A-->>P: refused
    end
    A->>N: POST /api/v1/Sms/SendOtp {number 09..., ClientName AZS, args} (synchronous)
    N-->>A: retval sId, smsId
    A->>DB: insert otp_challenge SENT {otp_id = sId}, keep Yaghut session server side
    A-->>P: challengeId, valid 120 s
    U->>P: 4-digit code
    P->>A: POST /api/auth/customer/otp/verify {challengeId, code}
    alt more than 120 s since sent
        A-->>P: code expired, request a new one (Notifier not called)
    end
    A->>N: POST /api/v1/Sms/OtpValidate {OtpCode, OtpId = sId}
    alt 410 or isValid false
        N-->>A: invalid
        A->>DB: wrong attempts + 1 (per customer), lock 15 min at 3
        A-->>P: wrong code
    else isValid true
        N-->>A: valid
        A->>DB: challenge VERIFIED (single use), reset counter
        A-->>P: one 30-minute session token, no refresh token
    end
